---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import { experience, education, years } from '../data/experience'
import { site } from '../data/site'
---

<Base
  title="About — Damilola Oluwafemi"
  description="Damilola Oluwafemi is a software engineer in the UK. Eight years across banking, fintech and crypto, now building developer tools. His career, how he works, and what he does outside work."
  path="/about"
>
  <div class="container page">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <div class="prose intro">
      <p>
        I'm Damilola Oluwafemi, a software engineer based in the {site.location}. I build developer tools and the products around them.
      </p>
      <p>
        I started on the front end at a bank in Lagos and have spent most of my career on products where money moves: banking, fintech and a crypto exchange. Lately I've been working lower down the stack, on infrastructure that other engineers build on. <a class="link" href="/work/flaghoist">Flaghoist</a> is the current example.
      </p>
    </div>

    <section aria-labelledby="how-h" class="block">
      <h2 id="how-h">How I work</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>I like small interfaces I can verify. If a claim matters, I test it against reality before I make it, and I write down where a project loses as plainly as where it wins.</p>
        <p>I would rather ship something narrow that is correct than something broad that is nearly right, and I try to leave the reasons in the code and the repository, not in my head.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="exp-h" class="block">
      <h2 id="exp-h">Experience</h2>
      <ol role="list" class="ladder">
        {experience.map((r) => (
          <li data-reveal>
            <div class="when">{years(r)}</div>
            <div>
              <h3>
                {r.url ? <a class="link" href={r.url}>{r.org}</a> : r.org}
                <span class="role">{r.role}{r.orgNote ? `, ${r.orgNote}` : ''} · {r.where}</span>
              </h3>
              <p>{r.highlight}</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
      <p class="cv"><a class="btn" href="/cv.pdf">Download my CV (PDF)</a></p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="edu-h" class="block">
      <h2 id="edu-h">Education</h2>
      <p class="edu"><strong>{education.degree}</strong><br />{education.school}, {education.where}</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="life-h" class="block">
      <h2 id="life-h">Outside work</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>My hobbies take up a large chunk of my leisure. I love to travel, play FC25, listen to delightful music, or take evening strolls.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-block: var(--space-12) var(--space-8);
    max-inline-size: calc(var(--wide) - 200px);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-display);
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-block-end: var(--space-8);
  }
  .intro {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .block {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-16);
  }
  .block > h2 {
    margin-block-end: var(--space-6);
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .ladder {
    border-block-start: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .ladder li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-1) var(--space-8);
    padding-block: var(--space-6);
    border-block-end: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .ladder li {
      grid-template-columns: 11rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
  .when {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .ladder h3 {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--space-1) var(--space-3);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
  }
  .role {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }
  .ladder p {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-2);
    max-inline-size: var(--measure);
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }
  .cv {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-8);
  }
</style>
